hpc:SlurmConfigurationFile a owl:Class .
hpc:hasClusterName a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmConfigurationFile ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:ClusterName a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmConfigurationFile .
```

Additionally, for the Cluster Name constraint about using different names for each cluster when using a single database:

```
hpc:UniqueClusterName a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:ClusterName ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf hpc:hasClusterName ;
    rdfs:comment "Useful for differentiating clusters when using a single database." .
```
